@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-token
@sampleId = replace-with-sanitized-sample-uuid
@requestKey = replace-with-fixed-request-uuid

### 管理员显式执行三次复测；同次操作重试复用requestKey，服务端默认关闭Judge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/human-evaluations/{{sampleId}}/judge-runs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"idempotencyKey":"{{requestKey}}"}

### 最近二十次运行；人工未决时模型分数和理由隐藏
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/human-evaluations/{{sampleId}}/judge-runs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 按模型/模板版本分别报告人工一致性、复测稳定性、样本不足与失败
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/judge-reports
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
